# Two waits before lifting the silver, and they are the whole
# difference between life and death later. The dwarves' clock only
# runs while you are underground -- surface time is frozen for them
# -- so whoever is loitering at Y2 when you leave is still standing
# there whenever you return, however long the surface errands take.
# Under this seed the return plugh landed in a two-dwarf knife
# volley in the dark, fatally, on every timing of the surface side.
# Two extra cave-side turns here reshuffle the patrol instead: the
# same pair still meets the return, but every knife now misses.

wait
wait
get silver
n
off
plugh

drop gold
drop jewelry
drop coins
drop silver
drop rug
get bottle
get water

score

# Second Excursion
#
# The return arrives in darkness among the same two dwarves, but on
# the reshuffled timeline their knives all miss; light the lamp and
# walk on. They tail the descent in shrinking numbers -- three, two,
# one -- throwing the occasional knife past your ear, and at one
# point the pirate appears, catches sight of a dwarf, and runs away.
# Nobody connects. The axe is not in the Low N/S Passage where the
# walkthroughs grab it: under this seed it is lying one room on, in
# the Hall of the Mountain King.

