# The pirate pounces the instant the pearl is taken: "I'll just
# take all this booty and hide it away with me chest deep in the
# maze!" Emerald, trident, vase, and pearl -- thirteen points --
# gone in one sentence. This is not the disaster it reads as: the
# pirate's chest is itself one of the game's fifteen treasures,
# and it only becomes findable after he has robbed you to stock
# it. The robbery is mandatory; ours merely came early. Everything
# he took waits in the maze for the third excursion's planned
# recovery trip, so the surface drop-list below shrinks to the one
# thing he left us: the pillow. (It still matters -- the vase,
# when recovered, must land on it.)

get pearl
