# Third Excursion
#
# The long one: keys for the bear's chain, eggs for the troll's
# toll, spices from beyond the volcano, the diamonds, and the raid
# on the pirate's chest. Dwarves tail nearly every leg of it and a
# knife whistles past in the maze; under this timeline nothing
# lands. Three dialect notes, all caught live by the refusal guard:
# the troll hides UNDER his bridge until a first ne draws him out,
# and only then can the eggs be handed over; the bear is tamed with
# "give food to bear", not "feed bear"; and the diamonds fall to a
# plain walk along the west side of the fissure -- no magic rod, no
# crystal bridge, which idles the whole rod errand the walkthroughs
# spend a excursion on.

