# End Game
#
# All fifteen treasures are in the well house, which arms the
# closing clock the next time the cave is entered. One last point
# for carrying the magazines to Witt's End, then the waits: the
# "closing soon" announcement lands midway through them and "The
# cave is now closed" at the forty-second, teleporting us to the
# repository. The lamp is dimming by then; there is not much slack
# left in this timeline. The blast itself is the walkthroughs' one
# unanimous complaint -- nothing in the game hints at it -- but the
# choreography is simple: carry the rod to the northeast end, leave
# it, walk back southwest, and say the word.

